 "verdicts": {
  "Factory's Droid coding agent can be invoked from a Jira work item through Rovo Chat, pulling Jira and Confluence context via Atlassian MCP and writing results back to the work item.": 1,
  "On October 27, 2026, Atlassian announced that Factory's Droid coding agent can be invoked from a Jira work item through Rovo Chat, built as the Forge Remote Agent for Jira using the A2A protocol.": 1,
  "The Droid-in-Jira flow pulls Jira and Confluence context through Atlassian MCP, runs the task in the configured environment, streams progress into Jira chat, and writes results back to the work item.": 1,
  "The Factory Forge Remote Agent for Jira originated with a request from an enterprise customer in a regulated industry building a software factory in a highly controlled environment; it targets Jira Cloud customers with Rovo enabled, with each Factory organization linking to one Jira site.": 1
 }
